# Start a new book

Open SEED.html at [readitinabook.com](https://readitinabook.com). The first screen is [Books]{.ui}, the list of every book you make.

![The Books screen, with the New book button under Start and no books yet.](../Images/screen-books.png){.figure .screenshot}

1. Click [New book]{.ui}.
2. Type a *Title*, for example "The Lighthouse Keeper".
3. Type your name as the *Author*.
4. Leave *Generate cover image* ticked. SEED.html makes a simple cover from the title and author.
5. Click [Create]{.ui}.

![The New book window, with The Lighthouse Keeper as the title, an author, Generate cover image ticked, and the Create button.](../Images/screen-new-book.png){.figure .screenshot width=544}

Your book opens, ready to write. It already has one chapter, with a heading and a line of text for you to replace.

You can change the title and author later, so do not spend long on them now.
